she's always in a bikini,
ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່ານາງໃສ່ບິກິນີຢູ່ສະເໝີກໍ່ຕາມ,

1461
01:00:11,550 --> 01:00:13,675
- which doesn't even really make sense.
- I'd watch that show.
